---
import { Award, BookOpen, HeartHandshake } from 'lucide-astro';
import { SITE_CONFIG } from '@/data/siteConfig';
---

<section
  id="program-tahfidz"
  class="scroll-mt-24 py-14 md:py-20 bg-[#FAF8F5] border-b border-stone-200/80"
>
  <div class="container-12 gap-y-6 md:gap-y-8">
    <!-- Section Heading (Ringkas & Scannable) -->
    <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-8 space-y-2.5">
      <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-700">
        Keunggulan Pendidikan
      </p>
      <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-ink-heading tracking-tight">
        Mengaji Dari Nol Hingga Paham Makna.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-ink-body max-w-xl">
        Pembelajaran terstruktur bersama {SITE_CONFIG.stats.tahfidzTeachers}+ asatidz tanpa syarat sudah lancar membaca saat masuk.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Bento Grid 4 Tile Asimetris -->
    <div class="col-span-12 grid grid-cols-12 gap-4 md:gap-6">
      <!-- Tile 1 (7 Col): Alur Belajar Al-Qur'an -->
      <article class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-7 rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 border border-stone-200/90 flex flex-col justify-between gap-6">
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary-surface text-primary">
            <BookOpen class="h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true" />
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-ink-heading">
            Tahsin Bertahap &amp; Wajib Hafal Juz 30 Beserta Arti
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-ink-body leading-relaxed max-w-lg">
            Mulai dari pengenalan huruf hijaiyah sesuai level anak, setoran hafalan harian, hingga memahami terjemahan ayat agar diamalkan sehari-hari.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-primary-dark">
          <div class="rounded-xl bg-surface-alabaster px-3.5 py-2.5 border border-stone-200/80">
            01. Pemetaan Iqra (Dari Nol)
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl bg-surface-alabaster px-3.5 py-2.5 border border-stone-200/80">
            02. Hafal &amp; Paham Juz 30
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl bg-surface-alabaster px-3.5 py-2.5 border border-stone-200/80">
            03. Lanjut Juz 29 &amp; 28
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Tile 2 (5 Col): Kutipan Hadits (Amiri) -->
      <figure class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-5 rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 border border-stone-200/90 flex flex-col justify-between gap-4">
        <blockquote class="space-y-3">
          <p
            lang="ar"
            dir="rtl"
            class="font-arabic text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-primary-dark leading-[2.0] text-right"
          >
            خَيْرُكُمْ مَنْ تَعَلَّمَ الْقُرْآنَ وَعَلَّمَهُ
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink-heading italic leading-relaxed">
            “Sebaik-baik kalian adalah orang yang mempelajari Al-Qur'an dan mengajarkannya.”
          </p>
        </blockquote>
        <figcaption class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-700">
          HR. Al-Bukhari &bull; Ruh Pengabdian Sejak 1990
        </figcaption>
      </figure>

      <!-- Tile 3 (5 Col): Adab & Wisuda -->
      <article class="col-span-12 md:col-span-6 lg:col-span-5 rounded-2xl bg-primary-surface/65 p-6 sm:p-8 border border-primary/15 flex flex-col justify-between gap-5">
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-white text-primary border border-primary/15">
            <HeartHandshake class="h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true" />
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-ink-heading">
            Adab Harian &amp; Wisuda Tahfidz
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-ink-body leading-relaxed">
            Berdampingan langsung dengan Masjid At-Taqwa untuk pembiasaan sholat berjamaah dan prosesi Wisuda Tahfidz Akbar rutin bersama orang tua.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-primary-dark">
          <span class="rounded-lg bg-white px-3 py-1 border border-primary/15">Sholat Dhuha &amp; Dzuhur</span>
          <span class="rounded-lg bg-white px-3 py-1 border border-primary/15">Wisuda Tahfidz</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Tile 4 (7 Col): 52+ Pendidik & Umroh -->
      <article class="col-span-12 md:col-span-6 lg:col-span-7 rounded-2xl bg-primary-dark text-white p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between gap-6">
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gold-light">
            <Award class="h-4 w-4 text-gold-medium" aria-hidden="true" />
            <span>Asuhan {SITE_CONFIG.chairman}</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white">
            52+ Pendidik Hafidz &amp; Program Hadiah Umroh Guru
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-emerald-50/85 leading-relaxed max-w-lg">
            Keberkahan ilmu dijaga dengan memuliakan para guru pengajar Al-Qur’an melalui apresiasi Umroh rutin setiap tahun.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-3 border-t border-white/15">
          <div>
            <p class="font-heading text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-gold-medium">
              {SITE_CONFIG.stats.tahfidzTeachers}+ Guru
            </p>
            <p class="text-xs text-emerald-100/80">Pembina Hafidz/Hafidzah</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-heading text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-gold-medium">
              {SITE_CONFIG.stats.annualTeacherUmrahReward} Guru / Thn
            </p>
            <p class="text-xs text-emerald-100/80">Apresiasi Ibadah Umroh</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
